<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Caraustar cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Caraustar cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate/Johnson Lane said it downgraded Caraustar Industries Inc to neutral from buy on share price appreciation.</p>
<p>-- said the share price had moved close to the firm's 12-month target of $34.</p>
<p>-- said continues to view Caraustar as an attractive long-term investment &quot;given the firm's proven ability to grow earnings and market share in the consolidating U.S. recycled paperboard industry.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Carauster lost 1/2 to 30-7/8.</p>
</text>
